"""
WorkPulse Animated Mascot v2.1
A cute cartoon character that floats on screen with random animations.
Features:
- Random activities: thinking, working, running, jumping, waving, sleeping
- Timer display when tracking
- Same click functionality as pie button
- Draggable around screen
- Personalized speech bubbles and greetings
- Customizable mascot and user names
- Multiple mascot themes (Blob, Robot, Cat, Astronaut)
- End-of-day standup reminder
- Git activity detection and celebration
- Sleepy mode when idle
